s="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>└</span><span>┌</span><span>┐</span><span>┘</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Learn</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/topics/" data-motion="type"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>A</span><span>∆</span><span>∑</span><span>#</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Topics</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/shifts/" data-motion="vector"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>↑</span><span>↗</span><span>→</span><span>↘</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Shifts</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/developers/" data-motion="syntax"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>{</span><span>}</span><span>&lt;</span><span>&gt;</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Developers</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/readers/" data-motion="scan" aria-current="page"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>◌</span><span>◍</span><span>◉</span><span>◍</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Readers</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/privacy/" data-motion="iris"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>◐</span><span>◓</span><span>◑</span><span>◒</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Privacy</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/llms.txt" data-motion="scan"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>=</span><span>≡</span><span>⋮</span><span>≋</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Agent guide</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/contact/" data-motion="signal"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>·</span><span>:</span><span>∴</span><span>✦</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Contact</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/experiments/glyph-field/" data-motion="glitch"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>G</span><span>▓</span><span>╳</span><span>G</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Experiments</span><small>(Glyph)</small></span></a><a class="site-footer-link" href="/atlas/telegram/" data-motion="orbit"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>◎</span><span>⊹</span><span>◉</span><span>⌖</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Atlas</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link site-footer-social-link" href="https://t.me/qwgai" rel="me noopener" data-motion="telegram"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>➤</span><span>◉</span><span>↗</span><span>✦</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>Telegram</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link site-footer-social-link" href="https://x.com/lapembakuzi" rel="me noopener" data-motion="x"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>X</span><span>╳</span><span>×</span><span>✕</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>X</span></span></a><a class="site-footer-link site-footer-social-link" href="/rss.xml" data-motion="rss"><span class="site-footer-motion-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><span>◔</span><span>◑</span><span>◕</span><span>◉</span></span><span class="site-footer-link-copy"><span>RSS</span></span></a></nav></div><div class="desktop-site-nav"><nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/posts/" data-emphasis="editorial" data-summary-align="start" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-field-notes"><span class="primary-nav-label">Field Notes</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-field-notes" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Field Notes</strong><span>/posts/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Every story New Runtime publishes: the news itself, short and sourced.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">What happened, the concrete facts from the primary source, and what the source does not establish. One story, one note.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Field Notes contains"><span>New notes through the day</span><span>Each links its primary source</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/signals/" data-summary-align="start" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-signals"><span class="primary-nav-label">Signals</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-signals" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Signals</strong><span>/signals/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">The quintessence: what several Field Notes show together.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">A signal is written only when two or more notes converge on one meaning, in a few sentences with links to the notes behind it.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Signals contains"><span>A few signals a day at most</span><span>Each built from two or more notes</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/analysis/" data-emphasis="editorial" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-analysis"><span class="primary-nav-label">Analysis</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-analysis" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Analysis</strong><span>/analysis/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">What Field Notes do not carry: research, synthesis and second looks.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Deep research on open questions, takes built from several stories, the weekly metadox and retrospectives that check earlier analyses against what happened.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Analysis contains"><span>Built from several stories or a research question</span><span>Checked against the archive</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/forecasts/" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-forecasts"><span class="primary-nav-label">Forecasts</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-forecasts" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Forecasts</strong><span>/forecasts/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">The forecasts New Runtime made, graded when they come due.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Every forecast from an analysis is recorded with its probability and due date, then marked right or wrong.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Forecasts contains"><span>Open and graded forecasts</span><span>A public calibration record</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/trends/" data-summary-align="end" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-trends"><span class="primary-nav-label">Trends</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-trends" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Trends</strong><span>/trends/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Shifts and working theses: where the market and the stack are going.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Durable before-and-after shifts with what they make possible and what they retire, and the theses each week&#39;s news is tested against.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Trends contains"><span>Shifts, deltas and fading practices</span><span>Theses with revision conditions</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/topics/" data-summary-align="end" aria-describedby="primary-nav-summary-topics"><span class="primary-nav-label">Topics</span><span class="primary-nav-popover" id="primary-nav-summary-topics" role="tooltip"><span class="primary-nav-popover-panel"><span class="nav-popover-kicker">Section summary</span><span class="nav-popover-title"><strong>Topics</strong><span>/topics/</span></span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Topic hubs: one theme across notes, signals, analysis and trends.</span><span class="nav-popover-copy">Start here for a broad question and move into the records that answer it.</span><span class="nav-popover-points" aria-label="What Topics contains"><span>Cross-section counts and linked records</span><span>Best starting point for a broad question</span></span></span></span></a></nav><nav class="utility-nav" aria-label="Utility navigation"><a href="/sources/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><span>Sources</span></a><a href="/agents/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg><span>Agents</span></a><a href="/readers/" aria-current="page"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .6