<rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><path d="M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"></path><path d="M12 12V8"></path></svg></span></span><div class="rdd-hero-copy" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><p class="rdd-kind" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Agentic web &amp; MCP registries</p><h1 data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>histor</h1><p class="rdd-operator" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Operator unknown<span class="rdd-confidence is-low" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>low confidence</span></p><p class="rdd-purpose" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Self-described in its user-agent as &quot;histor/0.1.0&quot; making read-only MCP probes (initialize + tools/list only). No operator page or public documentation could be found as of 2026-10-23.</p></div></header><div class="rdd-layout" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><div class="rdd-main" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><section class="rdd-section" aria-labelledby="rdd-facts" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h2 id="rdd-facts" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Dossier</h2><dl class="rdd-facts" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Operator</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>unknown</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Documentation</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>None published</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>robots.txt token</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>None documented</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Feeds</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>monitoring</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Follows robots.txt</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><span class="rdd-robots is-unknown" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Not documented</span><small data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>A site histor.dev (&#39;The evidence layer for autonomous AI&#39;, HTTPS receipts for agents) exists, but no page found ties it to this UA; not attributed.</small></dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>How to verify</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Unknown</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Names in our logs</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><code data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>histor</code></dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Researched</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>23 Oct 2026</dd></div></dl></section><aside class="rdd-take" aria-labelledby="rdd-take-title" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><p class="rdd-take-label" id="rdd-take-title" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Why it matters to New Runtime · our interpretation</p><p data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Read-only MCP handshake probe; shows something is cataloguing or witnessing our tool list.</p></aside><section class="rdd-observed" aria-labelledby="rdd-observed-title" data-observed data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><header data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h2 id="rdd-observed-title" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Observed on New Runtime</h2><p data-observed-asof data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Baseline 2026-10-29 · 99-day window · loading live numbers…</p></header><dl class="rdd-tiles" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Requests</dt><dd data-o="total" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>189</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Days active</dt><dd data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><span data-o="days" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>32</span><small data-astro-cid-zizqt64t> / <span data-o="window" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>99</span></small></dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>First seen</dt><dd data-o="first" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>26 Sept 2026</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><dt data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Last seen</dt><dd data-o="last" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>28 Oct 2026</dd></div></dl><div class="rdd-badges" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><span class="rdd-recency is-regular" data-o="recency" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Regular</span><span class="rdd-chip" data-o="categories" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>other_bot</span></div><div class="rdd-bars" data-o="spark" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t></div><p class="rdd-bars-caption" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Daily requests across the observed window, square-root scale.</p><div class="rdd-identity" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h3 data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Identity check <small data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>claimed vs verified</small></h3><ul data-o="verification" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><li class="is-none" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>No per-family identity check is published for this reader; its name is a claim.</li></ul></div><div class="rdd-reads" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h3 data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>What it reads <small data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>crawler journeys · current window</small></h3><ul data-o="mix" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><li class="is-none" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>The crawler-journeys aggregate tracks reading depth for the busiest named crawlers only; this family is not among them.</li></ul><p class="rdd-materials" data-o="materials" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t></p><div class="rdd-routes" data-o="routes" hidden data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h4 data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Enters at · 7 days</h4><ol data-o="entry" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t></ol></div><div data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h4 data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Leaves from · 7 days</h4><ol data-o="exit" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t></ol></div></div></div></section><section class="rdd-section" aria-labelledby="rdd-sources" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><h2 id="rdd-sources" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>Sources</h2><ol class="rdd-sources" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><li data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><a href="https://histor.dev/" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>histor.dev</a><small data-astro-cid-zizqt64t>histor.dev/</small></li></ol></section></div><aside class="rdd-rail" data-astro-cid-zizqt64t><aside class="machine-panel" aria-label="Machine view"><div class="machine-panel-head"><div><strong>Machine view</strong><p>This dossier for agents.</p></div><span>agent-ready</span></div><ul class="machine-route-list"><li><a href="/readers/histor.json"><span>JSON</span><strong>Dossier